+-# 002 Privileged Teacher Observations
+-
+-## Goal
+-
+-在新实验任务中开启 V14 flat 的 MDP 域随机化，并把训练期随机化参数与真实动力学状态暴露给 privileged teacher / critic。目标是让 value 或 teacher 在 domain randomization 下看到更完整的系统状态，同时保持 deployed policy 输入不变。
+-
+-## Isolation
+-
+-- 不改变 `Robotics-Wheelbipe-V14-Flat-v0` 默认行为。
+-- 新增实验任务 `Robotics-Wheelbipe-V14-Flat-PrivObsPlus-v0`。
+-- policy obs 维度默认不变；只扩展 privileged/state 维度。
+-- MDP 域随机化只在新实验任务中开启；baseline flat 仍保持 `events = None`。
+-
+-## Proposed Code Scope
+-
+-- `source/agent_tasks/agent_tasks/direct/wheelbipe/wheelbipe_V14/env_cfg.py`
+-  - 新增 `WheelbipeV14FlatPrivObsPlusEnvCfg` / Play cfg。
+-  - 在新 cfg 中开启 V14 MDP 域随机化事件，例如 `events = EventCfgV14()`。
+-  - 增加 `num_single_privileged_obs` 和 `state_space`。
+-  - 为新增 privileged block 增加 clip/scale 配置，避免 torque/contact force 等量级过大。
+-- `source/agent_tasks/agent_tasks/direct/wheelbipe/wheelbipe_V14/env.py`
+-  - 在 critic/state obs 拼接中加入额外 privileged 量。
+-  - 同步更新 `get_privilaged_obs()`，保证 reset/termination extras 与 rollout critic obs 一致。
+-  - 如 Isaac Lab runtime API 不能直接读回随机化后的参数，则在 event/randomization 侧缓存质量、惯量、材料、刚度、阻尼等参数。
+-- `source/agent_tasks/agent_tasks/direct/wheelbipe/wheelbipe_V14/__init__.py`
+-  - 注册 train/play task。
+-
+-## Domain Randomization
+-
+-```yaml
+-domain_randomization:
+-  enabled: true
+-  source_cfg: EventCfgV14
+-  scope: new_task_only
+-```
+-
+-需要确认 `EventCfgV14` 中实际启用的随机项覆盖：
+-
+-- base / leg / wheel mass randomization。
+-- base / wheel / gimbal inertia randomization。
+-- wheel material randomization，包括 static friction、dynamic friction、restitution。
+-- joint friction / armature randomization。
+-- actuator stiffness / damping randomization。
+-- reset root pose randomization。
+-
+-## Privileged Extra Obs
+-
+-```yaml
+-privileged_extra_obs:
+-  joint_torque: true
+-  joint_acc: true
+-  wheel_body_lin_vel: true
+-  body_mass: true
+-  body_inertia: true
+-  joint_stiffness: true
+-  joint_damping: true
+-  root_pos: true
+-  root_vel: true
+-  material_properties: true
+-  wheel_contact_force: true
+-```
+-
+-Suggested block definitions:
+-
+-- `joint_torque`: `robot.data.applied_torque` for selected robot joints. Prefer the same ordered joint set used by V14 bookkeeping, plus wheel/gimbal joints if they affect dynamics.
+-- `joint_acc`: `robot.data.joint_acc` for the same joint set as `joint_torque`.
+-- `wheel_body_lin_vel`: wheel link linear velocity, preferably body-frame relative velocity. Keep world-frame only if body-frame conversion is inconvenient.
+-- `body_mass`: randomized mass for base, leg links, wheels, and gimbal links.
+-- `body_inertia`: randomized inertia for base, wheels, and gimbal links.
+-- `joint_stiffness`: randomized actuator stiffness / gain values.
+-- `joint_damping`: randomized actuator damping values.
+-- `root_pos`: root world position or a normalized local/root-height representation. If absolute x/y hurts translation invariance, keep z and orientation-related terms only.
+-- `root_vel`: root linear and angular velocity. Current critic already has `root_lin_vel_b` and `root_ang_vel_b`; add world-frame values only because this experiment explicitly tests richer privileged state.
+-- `material_properties`: wheel material parameters, at minimum static friction, dynamic friction, and restitution.
+-- `wheel_contact_force`: wheel contact force norm or xyz vector from contact sensor history. Prefer compact per-wheel norm/peak first.
+-
+-维度需要在实现时由实际 joint/body/material 选择最终确定，并写入 cfg 的 `num_single_privileged_obs` / `state_space`。
