+-# 024 Mood MoE Student Distillation
+-
+-## 目标
+-
+-基于 023 轻量 MoE，新增 actor-only student 蒸馏骨架，用更小的单路 recurrent policy 替代 dense MoE 部署图。
+-
+-## 任务
+-
+-- Train: `Robotics-Wheelbipe-V14-Mood-MT-MoE-Student-v0`
+-- Play: `Robotics-Wheelbipe-V14-Mood-MT-MoE-Student-Play-v0`
+-- Runner: `WheelbipeV14MoodMTMoEStudentRunnerCfg`
+-
+-## Student 网络
+-
+-```text
+-policy_obs -> MLP[128] -> GRU128 -> MLP[64] -> action(10)
+-```
+-
+-最后一层 action head 零初始化，使 student 从接近零动作开始，避免 smoke 和早期蒸馏阶段出现过大的随机动作。
+-
+-部署图接口：
+-
+-```text
+-policy_obs + actor_hidden_in -> actions + actor_hidden_out
+-```
+-
+-## 蒸馏接口
+-
+-第一版只预留 BC 蒸馏：
+-
+-```text
+-L_bc = MSE(student_action_mean, teacher_action_mean)
+-```
+-
+-teacher checkpoint 字段保留在 runner cfg 中；本轮没有 023 正式 checkpoint，因此 smoke 可用零 teacher action 验证接口、hidden reset、loss shape 和存储流程。
+-
+-## Smoke
+-
+-```bash
+-source /home/robotlab/RL/isaacsim/setup_conda_env.sh
+-/home/robotlab/miniconda3/envs/env_wheelbipe/bin/python scripts/rsl_rl/train.py \
+-  --task Robotics-Wheelbipe-V14-Mood-MT-MoE-Student-v0 \
+-  --num_envs=64 \
+-  --max_iterations=2 \
+-  --run_name smoke_024_mood_moe_student \
+-  --device=cuda:0 \
+-  --headless
+-```
