+-       • Flat-Ground Controller: A periodic gait controller designed for stable and efficient loco-
+-         motion on flat terrain.
+-       • Rough-Terrain Controller: A non-periodic controller tailored for stair climbing and
+-         traversal of uneven terrain.
+-
