+-aligned vector, ωt the angular velocity, and vtcmd the commanded linear and angular velocities
+-(vx , vy , ωz ). No robot-specific identifiers are used; policies are trained purely from proprioceptive
+-and command data to encourage generalization across robots.
+-
+-2.2   Policy Architecture
+-
